  "description": "Custom-fit for 2017–2026 Ridgeline 5ft beds, with this premium soft roll-up tonneau cover designed for 5ft beds with a track rail system. Crafted from durable double-layer PVC, it provides complete protection from dust, water, and UV rays, ensuring your cargo stays secure in all weather conditions. The innovative tension latch system offers hassle-free access to your truck bed, and installation is quick and easy, with no drilling required. Perfect for daily use or long trips, this cover combines functionality and style to upgrade your truck.\nFeatures\nComplete Protection: Shields your truck bed from dust, water, and UV rays, ensuring cargo stays safe and dry.\nDurable Construction: Made from high-quality double-layer PVC for long-lasting performance and weather resistance.\nInnovative Tension Latch: Easy lock and unlock system allows full access to your truck bed with minimal effort.\nQuick, Drill-Free Installation: Easy to install with no drilling needed; includes all necessary tools and clear instructions.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation recommended for safety\nFitment\nCompatible with 2017-2026 Honda Ridgeline with 5 Feet Bed",
